### 3) What are the top-selling genres by total revenue? Why it's valuable: Understanding which music genres generate the most revenue directly informs catalog expansion, licensing priorities, and targeted marketing campaigns.

#### SQL SOLUTION:

SELECT
    g.name,
    SUM(i.UnitPrice*i.Quantity) as total_revenue,
    COUNT(i.TrackId) as tracks_sold,
    SUM(i.UnitPrice * i.Quantity) / COUNT(i.TrackId) AS avg_track_value
FROM genres g
JOIN tracks t ON g.GenreId = t.GenreId
JOIN invoice_items i ON t.TrackId = i.TrackId
GROUP BY g.name
ORDER BY total_revenue DESC;

