### 4) Which artists have the highest organic popularity based on playlist inclusions? Why it's valuable: Playlist inclusions indicate user engagement and organic popularity that may not perfectly correlate with direct sales. This helps predict future hits and informs which artists to feature on the store's homepage.

#### SQL SOLUTION:

SELECT
    a.name,
    COUNT(pt.TrackId) as playlist_inclusions
FROM artists a
JOIN albums aa ON a.ArtistId = aa.ArtistId
JOIN tracks t ON aa.AlbumId = t.AlbumId
JOIN playlist_track pt ON t.TrackId = pt.TrackId
GROUP BY a.name
ORDER BY playlist_inclusions DESC
LIMIT 10;

